  "notes": [
    "No external32kHz crystal. Native USB GPIO19/20; UART recovery retained.",
    "Two user buttons owned bylighting contract; GPIO2 is required active-low deep-sleep wake input.",
    "GPIO40 EPD_EN may be driven high by USB-OTG download ROM; powering display in recovery is benign. Avoid assigning GPIO40 to switched accessory data.",
    "Straps GPIO45/46 have10k pulldowns; GPIO0 BOOT10k pullup. GPIO3 unconnected.",
    "External I2C and SAO are separate from onboard bus; prohibit self-powered accessories until isolation is qualified.",
    "R207 100k grounds EPD_EN during MCU high-impedance states; USB-OTG ROM can still intentionally drive GPIO40 high."
  ]
